#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3422
msgid "ANOVA: Two-Factor Tool"
msgstr "ANOVA: verktyg med två faktorer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3424
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can perform two factor fixed effects "
"ANOVAs with and without replication. The same dialog is used and the "
"appropriate tool is selected depending on whether the number of rows per "
"sample is 1 or larger than 1."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan utföra tvåfaktors-ANOVA med fasta "
"effekter, både med och utan upprepning. Samma dialogruta används; rätt "
"verktyg väljs beroende på om antalet rader per urval är 1 eller fler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3430
msgid "ANOVA: Two-Factor Without Replication Tool"
msgstr "ANOVA: verktyg med två faktorer utan upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3432
msgid ""
"If the number of rows per sample is given as 1, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> performs a two factor fixed effects "
"ANOVA without replication. Each column of the input range is interpreted as "
"a level of the first factor while each row is interpreted as a level of the "
"second factor."
msgstr ""
"Om antalet rader per urval är 1 utför <application>Gnumeric</application> en"
" tvåfaktors-ANOVA med fasta effekter utan upprepning. Varje kolumn i "
"indataområdet motsvarar en nivå av den första faktorn och varje rad en nivå "
"av den andra faktorn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3437 C/gnumeric.xml:3491
msgid ""
"The first row and column of the range may contain labels for these levels. "
"In this case the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option should "
"be selected."
msgstr ""
"Den första raden och kolumnen i området kan innehålla etiketter för "
"nivåerna. Välj i så fall alternativet "
"<quote><guibutton>Etiketter</guibutton></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3440 C/gnumeric.xml:3494
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Alpha:</guilabel></quote> entry specifies the "
"significance level which is by default 5%."
msgstr ""
"Fältet <quote><guilabel>Alfa:</guilabel></quote> anger signifikansnivån, som"
" standard 5 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3443
msgid "Using the 2-factor ANOVA Without Replication Tool"
msgstr "Använda verktyget för 2-faktors-ANOVA utan upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3444
msgid ""
"See <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-without-tool-ex1\"/> for an example of "
"a completed dialog and <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-without-tool-ex2\"/>"
" for the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-without-tool-ex1\"/> för ett exempel på "
"en ifylld dialogruta och <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-without-tool-"
"ex2\"/> för motsvarande resultat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3451
msgid "2-factor ANOVA Without Replication Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogruta för 2-faktors-ANOVA utan upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3453
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2wo-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a two "
