msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2wo-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"tvåfaktors-ANOVA utan upprepning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3466
msgid "Output From a 2-factor ANOVA Without Replication"
msgstr "Resultat från 2-faktors-ANOVA utan upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3468
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2wo-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output "
"from a two factor ANOVA without replication analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ANOVA2wo-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av resultatet "
"från en tvåfaktors-ANOVA utan upprepning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3483
msgid "ANOVA: Two-Factor With Replication Tool"
msgstr "ANOVA: verktyg med två faktorer och upprepning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3484
msgid ""
"If the number of rows per sample is larger than 1, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> performs a two factor fixed effects "
"ANOVA with replication. Each column of the input range is interpreted as a "
"level of the first factor while groups of rows (the number of rows in each "
"group given by the <quote><guilabel>number of rows per "
"sample</guilabel></quote> value) are interpreted as levels of the second "
"factor."
msgstr ""
"Om antalet rader per urval är större än 1 utför "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> en tvåfaktors-ANOVA med fasta effekter "
"och upprepning. Varje kolumn i indataområdet motsvarar en nivå av den första"
" faktorn. Grupper av rader motsvarar nivåer av den andra faktorn; antalet "
"rader i varje grupp anges i fältet <quote><guilabel>Antal rader per "
"urval</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3496
msgid ""
"See <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-with-tool-ex1\"/> for an example of a "
"completed dialog and <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-with-tool-ex2\"/> for "
"the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-with-tool-ex1\"/> för ett exempel på en "
"ifylld dialogruta och <xref linkend=\"anova-two-factor-with-tool-ex2\"/> för"
" motsvarande resultat."

