#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3532
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will estimate missing values for each "
"level combination as the mean of the existing values in that combination. "
"The degrees of freedom are adjusted appropriately."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> skattar saknade värden för varje "
"nivåkombination som medelvärdet av de befintliga värdena i kombinationen. "
"Frihetsgraderna justeras därefter."
